<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Partner with Niyantron to introduce OpsBridge and Enterprise ERP, manage opportunities and track recurring commissions."><title>Niyantron Partner Programme</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Sora:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet"><style>
:root{--bg:#061220;--ink:#f5f9ff;--muted:#92a8c2;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.11);--blue:#2878ff;--cyan:#2ee4ff;--green:#2ee6a6;--gold:#ffc857}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.container{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}a{color:inherit}.nav{position:fixed;z-index:50;inset:0 0 auto;background:rgba(5,16,29,.9);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);backdrop-filter:blur(18px)}.nav-inner{height:80px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none}.brand img{height:40px;filter:brightness(0) invert(1);width:auto}.brand span{padding-left:12px;border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:#8ea5c0;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}.nav-links{display:flex;gap:27px;color:#a5b6ca;font-size:12px;font-weight:750}.nav-links a{text-decoration:none}.nav-links a:hover{color:#fff}.login{padding:11px 17px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#09254c;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:850}.hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:130px 0 70px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 40%,rgba(46,230,166,.15),transparent 26%),radial-gradient(circle at 64% 18%,rgba(40,120,255,.2),transparent 28%),linear-gradient(125deg,#05101d,#09213d)}.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.025) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.025) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:52px 52px;mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,transparent,#000)}.hero-grid{position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:75px;align-items:center}.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:#baf5dc;font-size:10px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}.hero h1{margin:22px 0 0;font:700 clamp(48px,5.8vw,78px)/1.02 Sora;letter-spacing:-.06em}.gradient{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green),var(--cyan) 54%,#6f8cff);-webkit-background-clip:text;color:transparent}.hero p{max-width:640px;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:28px}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:850}.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16ad79,#2878ff)}.btn-ghost{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);background:rgba(255,255,255,.05)}.pipeline{padding:16px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:28px;background:rgba(7,25,43,.72);box-shadow:0 45px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.42);transform:rotateY(-7deg) rotateX(3deg)}.pipe-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 12px 18px;color:#7893b2;font-size:9px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.13em}.pipe-head span:last-child{color:var(--green)}.pipe{display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 1fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:14px;margin-bottom:9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04)}.pipe i{width:40px;height:40px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(46,230,166,.1);color:var(--green)}.pipe strong{display:block;font-size:12px}.pipe small{color:#778eaa;font-size:9px}.pipe em{color:var(--gold);font-size:9px;font-style:normal;font-weight:850}
.opportunity{padding:100px 0}.section-head{max-width:760px}.section-head small{color:var(--green);font-size:10px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase}.section-head h2{margin:13px 0 0;font:700 clamp(38px,4.7vw,58px)/1.08 Sora;letter-spacing:-.05em}.section-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}.product-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:42px}.product{position:relative;min-height:340px;padding:30px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(17,42,70,.88),rgba(7,20,35,.98));overflow:hidden}.product:before{content:"";position:absolute;right:-70px;top:-70px;width:240px;height:240px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);filter:blur(85px);opacity:.17}.product i{color:var(--accent);font-size:25px}.product h3{margin:25px 0 0;font:700 27px Sora}.product p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.65}.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:20px}.tags span{padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;color:#bfd0e2;font-size:9px;font-weight:750}.flow{padding:100px 0;background:#09182a}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin-top:42px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden}.step{padding:28px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}.step:last-child{border:0}.step span{width:34px;height:34px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(46,230,166,.1);color:var(--green);font-weight:850}.step h3{margin:19px 0 0;font:700 16px Sora}.step p{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.6}.benefits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:30px}.benefit{padding:23px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:19px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035)}.benefit i{color:var(--gold);font-size:20px}.benefit strong{display:block;margin-top:14px;font-size:12px}.benefit p{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;line-height:1.55}.cta{margin:90px auto;padding:48px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:30px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%,rgba(46,230,166,.16),transparent 34%),#0b1b30}.cta h2{margin:0;font:700 37px/1.1 Sora}.cta p{color:var(--muted)}.footer{padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:#7288a3;font-size:11px}.footer-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}.footer img{height:24px;filter:brightness(0) invert(1);opacity:.75}
@media(max-width:900px){.nav-links{display:none}.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pipeline{transform:none}.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.step:nth-child(2){border-right:0}.step{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.cta{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}@media(max-width:620px){.container{width:calc(100% - 28px)}.nav-inner{height:70px}.brand img{height:34px}.brand span{display:none}.login{padding:10px 12px}.hero{padding-top:115px}.hero h1{font-size:45px}.product-grid,.steps,.benefits{grid-template-columns:1fr}.step{border-right:0}.opportunity,.flow{padding:72px 0}.cta{padding:32px 22px}.cta h2{font-size:30px}.footer-row{flex-direction:column}}
</style></head><body><nav class="nav"><div class="container nav-inner"><a class="brand" href="https://www.niyantron.com"><img src="{{ asset('brand/niyantron-logo-transparent.png') }}" alt="Niyantron"><span>PARTNER NETWORK</span></a><div class="nav-links"><a href="#opportunity">Products</a><a href="#flow">How it works</a><a href="https://www.niyantron.com/contact">Contact</a></div><a class="login" href="https://platform.niyantron.com/login"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right"></i> Partner sign in</a></div></nav>
<main><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i>Niyantron Partner Programme</span><h1>Build recurring value around <span class="gradient">connected enterprise products.</span></h1><p>Introduce OpsBridge and Niyantron ERP to organizations that need operational control. Manage qualified opportunities, collaborate through the sales journey and track commissions from one partner workspace.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://platform.niyantron.com/login">Enter partner workspace <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:partner@niyantron.com?subject=Niyantron%20Partner%20Programme">Discuss partnership</a></div></div><div class="pipeline"><div class="pipe-head"><span>PARTNER OPPORTUNITY GRAPH</span><span>● COMMISSION READY</span></div><div class="pipe"><i class="bi bi-person-plus"></i><div><strong>Qualified lead</strong><small>Organization, challenge and product interest</small></div><em>CAPTURE</em></div><div class="pipe"><i class="bi bi-easel2"></i><div><strong>Discovery and demo</strong><small>Collaborative solution mapping</small></div><em>PROGRESS</em></div><div class="pipe"><i class="bi bi-building-check"></i><div><strong>Customer onboarded</strong><small>Subscription linked to partner record</small></div><em>CONVERT</em></div><div class="pipe"><i class="bi bi-cash-coin"></i><div><strong>Commission tracked</strong><small>Visibility after customer payment</small></div><em>EARN</em></div></div></div></section>
<section class="opportunity" id="opportunity"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><small>Two products, broader opportunity</small><h2>Recommend the product that matches the customer’s real problem.</h2><p>You do not need to force every prospect into one platform. Start with the right product and expand when the organization is ready.</p></div><div class="product-grid"><article class="product" style="--accent:#2ee4ff"><i class="bi bi-hdd-network"></i><h3>OpsBridge opportunities</h3><p>For organizations struggling with IT assets, endpoint visibility, software compliance, employee operations, maintenance or lifecycle evidence.</p><div class="tags"><span>ITAM</span><span>Endpoint agent</span><span>Software governance</span><span>HRMS</span><span>AMC</span><span>Disposal</span></div></article><article class="product" style="--accent:#a58fff"><i class="bi bi-command"></i><h3>ERP opportunities</h3><p>For trading and service businesses that need controlled procurement, dynamic QC, inventory identity, CRM, sales, finance and reports.</p><div class="tags"><span>Procurement</span><span>Dynamic QC</span><span>Barcoding</span><span>Inventory</span><span>CRM</span><span>Finance</span></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="flow" id="flow"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><small>Transparent partner journey</small><h2>Know what happens after you introduce an opportunity.</h2><p>The partner workspace keeps the lead, sales progress, onboarding and commission context connected.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><span>1</span><h3>Register</h3><p>Capture the organization, decision-maker, challenge and likely product.</p></div><div class="step"><span>2</span><h3>Collaborate</h3><p>Work with Niyantron on discovery, product demonstration and proposal.</p></div><div class="step"><span>3</span><h3>Convert</h3><p>Customer subscription and selected products are provisioned centrally.</p></div><div class="step"><span>4</span><h3>Track</h3><p>See eligible commission and payment status in the partner workspace.</p></div></div><div class="benefits"><div class="benefit"><i class="bi bi-eye"></i><strong>Opportunity visibility</strong><p>Track the commercial journey instead of chasing updates over messages.</p></div><div class="benefit"><i class="bi bi-mortarboard"></i><strong>Product enablement</strong><p>Learn positioning, workflows and qualification signals for both products.</p></div><div class="benefit"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i><strong>Protected attribution</strong><p>Qualified leads stay connected to your partner record and evidence.</p></div></div></div></section>
<div class="container cta"><div><h2>Ready to build with Niyantron?</h2><p>Sign in if you already have partner access, or start a partnership discussion.</p></div><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://platform.niyantron.com/login">Partner sign in</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:partner@niyantron.com?subject=Niyantron%20Partner%20Programme">Contact partner team</a></div></div></main><footer class="footer"><div class="container footer-row"><img src="{{ asset('brand/niyantron-logo-transparent.png') }}" alt="Niyantron"><span>Partner-led growth with transparent opportunity control.</span><span>&copy; {{ date('Y') }} Niyantron</span></div></footer></body></html>
